## Handoff for a new session

Give the new session this file, then paste something like:

```text
Continue the {{ project_name }} workstream. Start with dev/README.md, then the context file of the
active feature (its "current state" section) and the latest entries in dev/session-log.md.
Inspect git status and the current branch first and preserve unrelated changes.
Do not push commits, publish data or apply infrastructure without explicit authorization.
```

Fill in a **Gotchas** list here as you hit them (environment quirks, ordering constraints,
things that look wrong but are intentional).
